//! ## Examples
//!
//! ### Incorrect
//!
//! ```matlab
//! parfor i = 1:10          % PFPF: nested parfor
//!     parfor j = 1:10
//!     end
//!     break                % PFBRK: break inside parfor
//! end
//!
//! function y = f(a)
//!     arguments (Input, Output)   % FVIOA
//!         a (1,1) double = 1      % FVOOD: default on output
//!     end
//! end
//! ```
//!
//! ### Correct
//!
//! ```matlab
//! parfor i = 1:10
//!     x(i) = i;
//! end
//!
//! function y = f(a)
//!     arguments (Input)
//!         a (1,1) double
//!     end
//!     arguments (Output)
//!         y (1,1) double
//!     end
//!     y = a;
//! end
//! ```
//!
//! ## Configuration
//!
//! ```toml
//! [lint.rules.LANGUAGE_SPEC_ENGINE]
//! severity = "error"
//! disabled_checks = ["PFPF", "FVIOA"]
